  "bodyHash": "7rp3pv/K5dI=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#aff20f\"><strong>Buildscape: 建築師天堂的終極逃脫！</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#aff20f\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_7414843f-3271-4c03-91d8-e8bc960bf394.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"7\"></strong></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">■ 新增超過1500種可在生存模式中獲得的方塊</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 新增木材類型 Ashpen，其木材可染色</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 新增聖誕裝飾方塊、星星、燈串、發光燈、雪覆植被、冰柱等</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 新增可染色木板、物品展示框、紅石燈、沙子和花瓣</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 新增玻璃類型：馬賽克玻璃、釉面玻璃、工廠玻璃</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 新增工廠方塊、警示方塊、鋼製方塊等</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 新增瀑布方塊、煙霧通風口、立柱（基座）</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;◈ 向後移植了大量方塊</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_c6554fc9-de3e-4c2b-8b74-ab4226e56787.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"7\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">使用代碼 <span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>100K-BUILDSCAPE-CAKE <span style=\"color:#fff\">於&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuildscape.online%252fredeem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildscape 網頁</a>登入並兌換代碼</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_46e42941-8c66-405e-b476-cfff59c51558.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"288\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_c6554fc9-de3e-4c2b-8b74-ab4226e56787.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"7\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_bddaab14-bf9b-4afd-9be5-84ce17cfe17c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"468\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#0bf4bc\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_892c1d48-7bf2-4eed-900a-0f23f7e7a882.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"468\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#0bf4bc\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_c6554fc9-de3e-4c2b-8b74-ab4226e56787.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"7\"></span><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fitzmedga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1377354/description_5a48b876-bfd1-4624-a760-37482f9c61b6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"368\" height=\"184\"></a></span></p>",
